en: "Thanks to our sectoral knowledge, engineering experience, and hands-on training approach acquired since our establishment, we have contributed to thousands of trainees confidently stepping into the aviation industry. We view our trainings not merely as regulatory certification programs, but as comprehensive development programs preparing participants for real-life operations and professional careers."
